<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Brew & Bean Coffee Shop</title>
    <style>
        /* ===== RESET & BASE ===== */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            color: #3b2f2f;
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }

        ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        img {
            max-width: 100%;
        }

        /* ===== NAVBAR ===== */
        .navbar {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            z-index: 1000;
            padding: 18px 60px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
            background: transparent;
        }

        .navbar.scrolled {
            background: rgba(30, 20, 15, 0.95);
            padding: 12px 60px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .navbar .logo {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #fff;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .navbar .logo span {
            color: #d4a574;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 35px;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            position: relative;
            padding: 5px 0;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-links a::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background: #d4a574;
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover::after {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: #d4a574;
        }

        .hamburger {
            display: none;
            flex-direction: column;
            cursor: pointer;
            gap: 5px;
        }

        .hamburger span {
            width: 28px;
            height: 3px;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 3px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .hamburger.active span:nth-child(1) {
            transform: rotate(45deg) translate(5px, 6px);
        }

        .hamburger.active span:nth-child(2) {
            opacity: 0;
        }

        .hamburger.active span:nth-child(3) {
            transform: rotate(-45deg) translate(5px, -6px);
        }

        /* ===== HERO SECTION ===== */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(20, 12, 8, 0.85), rgba(60, 35, 20, 0.75)),
                        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1447933601403-0c6688de566e?w=1920') center/cover no-repeat;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0 20px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .hero::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 150px;
            background: linear-gradient(to top, #fff, transparent);
        }

        .hero-content {
            z-index: 1;
            animation: fadeInUp 1s ease;
        }

        .hero-content .tagline {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #d4a574;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .hero-content h1 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            text-shadow: 2px 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .hero-content h1 span {
            color: #d4a574;
            display: block;
        }

        .hero-content p {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: #e0d5cc;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 40px;
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            padding: 15px 40px;
            background: #d4a574;
            color: #1e140f;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #c4915e;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(212, 165, 116, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            padding: 15px 40px;
            background: transparent;
            color: #fff;
            border: 2px solid #d4a574;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: #d4a574;
            color: #1e140f;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        /* ===== SECTION COMMON ===== */
        .section {
            padding: 100px 60px;
        }

        .section-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .section-header .subtitle {
            color: #d4a574;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .section-header h2 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            color: #1e140f;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .section-header p {
            color: #6b5b50;
            max-width: 550px;
            margin: 15px auto 0;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }

        /* ===== KEUNGGULAN SECTION ===== */
        .keunggulan {
            background: #faf6f2;
        }

        .keunggulan-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 40px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .keunggulan-card {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .keunggulan-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .keunggulan-card .icon {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4a574, #c4915e);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 25px;
            font-size: 2rem;
        }

        .keunggulan-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #1e140f;
        }

        .keunggulan-card p {
            color: #6b5b50;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* ===== PRODUK SECTION ===== */
        .produk {
            background: #fff;
        }

        .produk-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 35px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .produk-card {
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
            background: #fff;
        }

        .produk-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        .produk-card .produk-img {
            height: 250px;
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .produk-card .produk-img::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.3), transparent);
        }

        .produk-card .badge {
            position: absolute;
            top: 15px;
            right: 15px;
            background: #d4a574;
            color: #1e140f;
            padding: 5px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .produk-card .produk-info {
            padding: 25px;
        }

        .produk-card .produk-info h3 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #1e140f;
        }

        .produk-card .produk-info p {
            color: #6b5b50;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .produk-card .produk-info .price {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #d4a574;
        }

        .produk-card .produk-info .price small {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #999;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        /* ===== TESTIMONI SECTION ===== */
        .testimoni {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e140f, #3b2518);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .testimoni .section-header h2 {
            color: #fff;
        }

        .testimoni .section-header p {
            color: #c4b5a8;
        }

        .testimoni-slider {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .testimoni-track {
            display: flex;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }

        .testimoni-card {
            min-width: 100%;
            padding: 50px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .testimoni-card .stars {
            color: #d4a574;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .testimoni-card blockquote {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #e8ddd4;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .testimoni-card .author {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .testimoni-card .author-avatar {
            width: 55px;
            height: 55px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #d4a574;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1e140f;
        }

        .testimoni-card .author-info h4 {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .testimoni-card .author-info span {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #a89585;
        }

        .slider-controls {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .slider-dot {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(212, 165, 116, 0.3);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .slider-dot.active {
            background: #d4a574;
            transform: scale(1.2);
        }

        /* ===== KONTAK SECTION ===== */
        .kontak {
            background: #faf6f2;
        }

        .kontak-wrapper {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 60px;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            align-items: start;
        }

        .kontak-info h3 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #1e140f;
        }

        .kontak-info p {
            color: #6b5b50;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .kontak-detail {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .kontak-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .kontak-item .icon-box {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4a574, #c4915e);
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .kontak-item .text h4 {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #1e140f;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .kontak-item .text span {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #6b5b50;
        }

        .kontak-form {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }

        .kontak-form .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .kontak-form label {
            display: block;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #1e140f;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .kontak-form input,
        .kontak-form textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            border: 2px solid #e8ddd4;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: border-color 0.3s;
            outline: none;
            font-family: inherit;
        }

        .kontak-form input:focus,
        .kontak-form textarea:focus {
            border-color: #d4a574;
        }

        .kontak-form textarea {
            height: 120px;
            resize: vertical;
        }

        .kontak-form button {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 16px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4a574, #c4915e);
            color: #1e140f;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .kontak-form button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(212, 165, 116, 0.4);
        }

        /* ===== FOOTER ===== */
        .footer {
            background: #1e140f;
            color: #c4b5a8;
            padding: 80px 60px 30px;
        }

        .footer-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 50px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto 50px;
        }

        .footer-col h3 {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .footer-col p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .footer-col .social-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .footer-col .social-links a {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            background: rgba(212, 165, 116, 0.15);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #d4a574;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .footer-col .social-links a:hover {
            background: #d4a574;
            color: #1e140f;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .footer-col ul li {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .footer-col ul li a {
            color: #a89585;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .footer-col ul li a:hover {
            color: #d4a574;
        }

        .footer-bottom {
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(196, 181, 168, 0.15);
            padding-top: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #6b5b50;
        }

        /* ===== ANIMATIONS ===== */
        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(40px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .animate-on-scroll {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(30px);
            transition: all 0.7s ease;
        }

        .animate-on-scroll.visible {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        /* ===== SCROLL TO TOP ===== */
        .scroll-top {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 30px;
            right: 30px;
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            background: #d4a574;
            color: #1e140f;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 50%;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            opacity: 0;
            visibility: hidden;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(212, 165, 116, 0.4);
            z-index: 999;
        }

        .scroll-top.show {
            opacity: 1;
            visibility: visible;
        }

        .scroll-top:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        /* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */
        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            .navbar {
                padding: 15px 30px;
            }

            .section {
                padding: 70px 30px;
            }

            .hero-content h1 {
                font-size: 3rem;
            }

            .kontak-wrapper {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .footer-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav-links {
                position: fixed;
                top: 0;
                right: -100%;
                width: 70%;
                height: 100vh;
                background: rgba(30, 20, 15, 0.98);
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 30px;
                transition: right 0.4s ease;
            }

            .nav-links.active {
                right: 0;
            }

            .nav-links a {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
            }

            .hamburger {
                display: flex;
                z-index: 1001;
            }

            .hero-content h1 {
                font-size: 2.3rem;
            }

            .hero-content p {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }

            .section-header h2 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            .footer-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 30px;
            }

            .footer {
                padding: 60px 30px 30px;
            }

            .testimoni-card {
                padding: 30px 15px;
            }

            .testimoni-card blockquote {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- ===== NAVBAR ===== -->
    <nav class="navbar" id="navbar">
        <a href="#" class="logo">Brew<span>&</span>Bean</a>
        <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
            <li><a href="#hero">Beranda</a></li>
            <li><a href="#keunggulan">Keunggulan</a></li>
            <li><a href="#produk">Menu</a></li>
            <li><a href="#testimoni">Testimoni</a></li>
            <li><a href="#kontak">Kontak</a></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="hamburger" id="hamburger">
            <span></span>
            <span></span>
            <span></span>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- ===== HERO SECTION ===== -->
    <section class="hero" id="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <p class="tagline">☕ Premium Coffee Experience</p>
            <h1>Nikmati Secangkir <span>Kebahagiaan</span></h1>
            <p>Biji kopi pilihan dari perkebunan terbaik Indonesia, diolah dengan penuh cinta oleh barista profesional kami untuk menghadirkan cita rasa yang tak terlupakan.</p>
            <div class="hero-buttons">
                <a href="#produk" class="btn-primary">Lihat Menu</a>
                <a href="#kontak" class="btn-secondary">Hubungi Kami</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== KEUNGGULAN SECTION ===== -->
    <section class="section keunggulan" id="keunggulan">
        <div class="section-header animate-on-scroll">
            <p class="subtitle">Mengapa Memilih Kami</p>
            <h2>Keunggulan Kami</h2>
            <p>Kami berkomitmen memberikan pengalaman kopi terbaik dengan standar kualitas tertinggi</p>
        </div>
        <div class="keunggulan-grid">
            <div class="keunggulan-card animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="icon">🌱</div>
                <h3>Biji Kopi Premium</h3>
                <p>100% biji kopi arabika pilihan dari Gayo, Toraja, dan Kintamani yang dipanen pada kematangan sempurna.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="keunggulan-card animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="icon">👨‍🍳</div>
                <h3>Barista Profesional</h3>
                <p>Tim barista bersertifikat dengan pengalaman lebih dari 24 tahun dalam meracik kopi berkualitas tinggi.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="keunggulan-card animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="icon">🏠</div>
                <h3>Suasana Nyaman</h3>
                <p>Interior hangat dan cozy yang dirancang khusus untuk membuat Anda betah berlama-lama menikmati kopi.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="keunggulan-card animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="icon">⚡</div>
                <h3>Penyajian Cepat</h3>
                <p>Proses pembuatan yang efisien tanpa mengorbankan kualitas, kopi Anda siap dalam 5 menit.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== PRODUK SECTION ===== -->
    <section class="section produk" id="produk">
        <div class="section-header animate-on-scroll">
            <p class="subtitle">Menu Favorit</p>
            <h2>Produk Kami</h2>
            <p>Pilihan menu kopi dan minuman spesial yang siap memanjakan lidah Anda</p>
        </div>
        <div class="produk-grid">
            <div class="produk-card animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="produk-img" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509042239860-f550ce710b93?w=600')">
                    <span class="badge">Best Seller</span>
                </div>
                <div class="produk-info">
                    <h3>Cappuccino Classic</h3>
                    <p>Espresso sempurna dengan steamed milk dan foam lembut yang creamy.</p>
                    <span class="price">Rp 35.000 <small>/ cup</small></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="produk-card animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="produk-img" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461023058943-07fcbe16d735?w=600')">
                    <span class="badge">New</span>
                </div>
                <div class="produk-info">
                    <h3>Caramel Macchiato</h3>
                    <p>Perpaduan espresso, vanilla, dan caramel sauce yang manis dan memikat.</p>
                    <span class="price">Rp 42.000 <small>/ cup</small></span>
                </div>
            </div>
